# Rebuildable IP output products; keep .xci, HDL wrappers, and memory images.
**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/cmodel/
**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/doc/
**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/hdl/
**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/misc/
**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/sim/
